# The four files tools/gen.mjs writes are NOT ignored. They are committed on purpose: a KWin
# script has no build step, so a clone, a release tarball and whatever the KDE Store unpacks all
# have to carry a package that already works. `tools/test.sh` fails if the committed copy drifts
# from what the generator would write.
